Dark Harrbor - Attribution Notice
==================================

Dark Harrbor is a provider-agnostic lazy-materialize media core for the arr
stack. It was designed with reference to and inspiration from several open-source
projects:

  - TorBoxarr    - TorBox API integration patterns
  - DebriDav     - Debrid-based media streaming approach
  - nzbget       - NZB download client (NNTP streaming concepts)
  - nzbdav       - NZB-to-WebDAV integration patterns

These projects influenced the design and implementation approach. Dark Harrbor
does not embed or derive from their source code. All original implementation
is MIT-licensed.

If you believe attribution is missing for a referenced project, please open
an issue or contact the maintainers.
